                  <body>Stub of CDIFCore::DataDownload. Carries data-description additions: cdif:hasPhysicalMapping, cdi:characterSet, cdi:fingerprint, and optional co-typing as cdi:TabularTextDataSet or cdi:StructuredDataSet (AbstractDataSet specializations).</body>
               </ownedComment>
               <name>DataDownload</name>
