                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="DataDescriptionWithStructure.ActionResult"/>
                  <body>Stub of CDIFCore::ActionResult (schema.org Action's schema:result). For data description, carries cdif:hasPhysicalMapping (to AbstractMapping) and cdi:characterSet.</body>
